      "title": "Entry TCP: details for $node",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "description": "A direct TCP connect from the picked node to each config's server address, with no xray in between. It separates a blocked address or port (down) from a blocked protocol (up while the tunnel probe fails)."
    },
